# Current-main's TOKEN_BINDING_DENY_CORPUS pins this file to a lidersea
# identity carrying naranjo's Secret. Only the own-instance binding may deny it.
Pod cloudflare-public/lidersea-connector-with-naranjo-token-env may take its Tunnel token only from the Secret derived from its own app.kubernetes.io/instance, through env.valueFrom.secretKeyRef and never through envFrom
